<?php $isIncome=$ledgerType==='income'; $label=$isIncome?'Thu':'Chi'; $otherLabel=$isIncome?'Người nộp tiền':'Đơn vị thụ hưởng'; $url=BASE_URL.'admin/'.($isIncome?'income':'expense'); ?>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px"><form action="<?php echo $url; ?>" style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap"><input class="form-control" name="q" value="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($filters['q']); ?>" placeholder="Nội dung, số chứng từ" style="width:190px"><select class="form-control" name="category_id"><option value="">Tất cả danh mục</option><?php foreach($categories as $cat): ?><option value="<?php echo $cat['category_id']; ?>" <?php echo $filters['category_id']==$cat['category_id']?'selected':''; ?>><?php echo htmlspecialchars($cat['category_name']); ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select><input class="form-control" type="date" name="from_date" value="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($filters['from_date']); ?>"><input class="form-control" type="date" name="to_date" value="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($filters['to_date']); ?>"><button class="btn btn-outline">Lọc</button></form><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openVoucher()">Lập phiếu <?php echo $label; ?></button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-header"><div class="card-title">Nội dung <?php echo $label; ?> (<?php echo $total; ?> phiếu)</div></div><div class="card-body p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>STT</th><th>Ngày <?php echo $label; ?></th><th>Nội dung <?php echo $label; ?></th><th>Số tiền</th><th>Số chứng từ</th><th><?php echo $otherLabel; ?></th><?php if($isIncome): ?><th>Người thu tiền</th><?php endif; ?><th>Tệp đính kèm</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($vouchers as $i=>$v): ?><tr><td><?php echo (($page-1)*20)+$i+1; ?></td><td><?php echo date('d/m/Y',strtotime($v['voucher_date'])); ?></td><td><b><?php echo htmlspecialchars($v['content']); ?></b><br><small><?php echo htmlspecialchars($v['category_name']?:'Chưa phân loại'); ?></small></td><td style="font-weight:600"><?php echo number_format($v['amount'],0,',','.'); ?> đ</td><td><?php echo htmlspecialchars($v['document_no']?:'-'); ?></td><td><?php echo htmlspecialchars($isIncome?$v['payer_name']:$v['beneficiary_name'])?:'-'; ?></td><?php if($isIncome): ?><td><?php echo htmlspecialchars($v['collector_name']?:'-'); ?></td><?php endif; ?><td><?php if($v['attachment_path']): ?><a target="_blank" href="<?php echo BASE_URL.'uploads/income/'.rawurlencode($v['attachment_path']); ?>">Xem tệp</a><?php else: ?>-<?php endif; ?></td><td><button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick='openVoucher(<?php echo json_encode($v,JSON_HEX_APOS|JSON_HEX_QUOT); ?>)'>Sửa</button> <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm text-danger" onclick="deleteVoucher(<?php echo $v['voucher_id']; ?>)">Xóa</button></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$vouchers): ?><tr><td colspan="9" style="padding:30px;text-align:center">Chưa có phiếu <?php echo strtolower($label); ?>.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div></div></div>
<?php if($pages>1): ?><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:15px"><?php for($p=1;$p<=$pages;$p++): ?><a class="btn btn-sm <?php echo $p==$page?'btn-primary':'btn-outline'; ?>" href="<?php echo $url.'?'.http_build_query(array_filter(array_merge($filters,['page'=>$p]))); ?>"><?php echo $p; ?></a><?php endfor; ?></div><?php endif; ?>
<div id="voucher-modal" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:#0008;z-index:1000;padding:25px;overflow:auto"><div class="card" style="max-width:720px;margin:auto"><div class="card-header"><div class="card-title">Phiếu <?php echo $label; ?></div></div><div class="card-body"><form id="voucher-form" action="<?php echo BASE_URL; ?>api/saveIncomeVoucher" enctype="multipart/form-data"><input type="hidden" name="type" value="<?php echo $ledgerType; ?>"><input type="hidden" name="voucher_id"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px"><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Ngày *</label><input class="form-control" type="date" name="voucher_date" value="<?php echo date('Y-m-d'); ?>" required></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Danh mục</label><select class="form-control" name="category_id"><option value="">Chọn danh mục</option><?php foreach($categories as $cat): ?><option value="<?php echo $cat['category_id']; ?>"><?php echo htmlspecialchars($cat['category_name']); ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><div class="form-group" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label class="form-label">Nội dung *</label><input class="form-control" name="content" required></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Số tiền *</label><input class="form-control" type="number" min="1" name="amount" required></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Số chứng từ</label><input class="form-control" name="document_no"></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label"><?php echo $otherLabel; ?></label><input class="form-control" name="<?php echo $isIncome?'payer_name':'beneficiary_name'; ?>"></div><?php if($isIncome): ?><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Người thu tiền</label><input class="form-control" name="collector_name"></div><?php endif; ?><div class="form-group" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label class="form-label">Tệp đính kèm (tối đa 10MB)</label><input class="form-control" type="file" name="attachment" accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx,.xls,.xlsx,.jpg,.jpeg,.png"></div></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:16px"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" onclick="closeVoucher()">Hủy</button><button class="btn btn-primary">Lưu phiếu</button></div></form></div></div></div>
<script>const modal=document.getElementById('voucher-modal'),form=document.getElementById('voucher-form');function openVoucher(v){form.reset();if(v)Object.keys(v).forEach(k=>{if(form.elements[k])form.elements[k].value=v[k]||''});modal.style.display='block'}function closeVoucher(){modal.style.display='none'}form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();fetch(form.action,{method:'POST',body:new FormData(form)}).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>d.status===200?location.reload():alert(d.message||'Có lỗi'))});function deleteVoucher(id){if(!confirm('Xóa phiếu này?'))return;let f=new FormData();f.append('voucher_id',id);fetch('<?php echo BASE_URL; ?>api/deleteIncomeVoucher',{method:'POST',body:f}).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>d.status===200?location.reload():alert(d.message));}</script>
